  if (!note.observation) issues.push('missing observation');
  if (!note.change) issues.push('missing change'); // "a critique is an opinion plus a fix"
  return { valid: issues.length === 0, issues };
}
```

It accepts "It feels busy" + "Make it pop" as a valid critique. It reveals **`visual-design-judgment.m2`**: treating critique as personal opinion, with no principle or user outcome.

